  "subject": "a woman who wakes up with a cricked neck and can only turn her whole body, so all day her boss, her crush and a bus driver think she is snubbing them",
  "caption": "Cantonese garage punk, 1960s-style revival like Hong Kong's NYPD scene. Fuzzed bar-chord electric guitar with tremolo picking, wheezy Farfisa-style combo organ riff, pick-played driving bass, fast trashy drums on the snare and crash. Raw lo-fi room recording, overdriven amps. Female alto with an edgy but clearly sung melody, gang backing shouts on the hook. 172 BPM, A major. Loud, sheepish and funny. No metal growls, no autotune, no rap, no polished pop-punk gloss, no synths.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n今朝醒返瞓捩頸\n條頸硬到好似木板\n想望一望個鬧鐘\n成個人要轉埋過去\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n唔好叫我 唔好叫我\n我淨係可以望前面\n\n[Chorus]\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n唔係我扮睇唔到你\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n轉頭就要轉成個人\n\n[Verse]\n老闆喺左邊講嘢\n我定晒格望住牆\n佢話我今日好大牌\n我想解釋又轉唔到\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n唔好叫我 唔好叫我\n我淨係可以望前面\n\n[Chorus]\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n唔係我扮睇唔到你\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n連老闆都以為我嬲\n\n[Verse]\n隔籬組阿Ken講早晨\n我成個身轉過去\n嚇到佢跌咗杯咖啡\n我哋兩個笑到彎腰\n\n[Bridge]\n貼張藥膏 熱敷一陣\n聽日就會轉得返\n\n[Chorus]\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n今日先知阿Ken會笑\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n聽日我自己轉頭望佢\n\n[Bridge]\n貼張藥膏 熱敷一陣\n聽日就會轉得返\n\n[Chorus]\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n唔係我扮睇唔到你\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n轉頭就要轉成個人\n\n[Outro]\n落枕呀 落枕呀\n條頸聽日再算",
